# Text files as LF in every checkout, Windows' too (core.autocrlf): the
# test scripts run under bash and the core's transcripts compare byte
# for byte.  The drivers' .inf files stay as they came (CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.inf -text
# The Courier's firmware and NVRAM images (dsp/test/usr) are binary
dsp/test/usr/* -text
